    <data key="d0">Accenture Circulus Supply Chain Solution</data>
    <data key="d1" />
    <data key="d2">Architecture uses IoT Core, EKS (Hyperledger Fabric), DynamoDB off-chain storage, SageMaker analytics, CloudHSM for cryptography keys, and SNS for user alerts.</data>
